hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2742","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Al-`Ala bin Kurayb, who said: Narrated to us Abu Usamah, from Hisham, from his father, from `Aishah (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to me, \"If your people were not so recent in their disbelief, I would have demolished the Ka`bah and rebuilt it upon the foundations laid by Ibrahim (Abraham). For indeed, the Quraish had shortened its construction and made a back door for it.\" Abu Bakr ("
